body.p:
Sharma discloses contact-free sensors 160 which are coupled to a processor 140 of an aircraft occupant health, safety, and comfort management system 120. See SharmaSVG
{EMBED HERE}
0.150.080017. However, Sharma fails to disclose or suggest a processor 140 accommodated within a first electronics housing which is designed to preprocess the passenger-based sensor data. The remaining cited references fail to resolve the deficiencies of Starke and Sharma.
